    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rumble Burst \u2013 High-Speed Hack &amp; Smash x Wave-Based Survival Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the sprawling game world of <i>Unlimited Fantasia</i> within the metaverse &quot;Unreally&quot;, millions of players seek adventure. Among them, the strongest VTuber player, <strong>Michell</strong>, sets out on a new journey. Stripped of all her skills and levels, she enters the mysterious <i>Rumble Burst Island</i>, where survival starts from zero. Now, it's time to prove her true strength once again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rumble Burst</strong> fuses thrilling hack-and-smash action with wave-based survival gameplay in a fresh, explosive experience. Smash your enemies across the battlefield, trigger devastating chain combos, and level up your skills in real time. Build unique strategies with random skill upgrades and powerful item drops, then face off against fierce bosses in intense showdowns. Can Michell conquer the island and reclaim her title?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Face stronger enemies with each wave<br>\ud83d\udd39 Unleash devastating &quot;Smash Combos&quot; for maximum destruction<br>\ud83d\udd39 Build unique strategies with random skills and item drops<br>\ud83d\udd39 Challenge tough bosses that test your reflexes and tactics<br>\ud83d\udd39 Full replayability with score attacks, speedruns, and custom challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme speed. Extreme power. Extreme combos.</strong><br>Smash everything in your path and claim your place as the ultimate survivor on Rumble Burst Island!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rumble Burst \u2013 High-Speed Hack &amp; Smash x Wave-Based Survival Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the sprawling game world of <i>Unlimited Fantasia</i> within the metaverse &quot;Unreally&quot;, millions of players seek adventure. Among them, the strongest VTuber player, <strong>Michell</strong>, sets out on a new journey. Stripped of all her skills and levels, she enters the mysterious <i>Rumble Burst Island</i>, where survival starts from zero. Now, it's time to prove her true strength once again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rumble Burst</strong> fuses thrilling hack-and-smash action with wave-based survival gameplay in a fresh, explosive experience. Smash your enemies across the battlefield, trigger devastating chain combos, and level up your skills in real time. Build unique strategies with random skill upgrades and powerful item drops, then face off against fierce bosses in intense showdowns. Can Michell conquer the island and reclaim her title?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Face stronger enemies with each wave<br>\ud83d\udd39 Unleash devastating &quot;Smash Combos&quot; for maximum destruction<br>\ud83d\udd39 Build unique strategies with random skills and item drops<br>\ud83d\udd39 Challenge tough bosses that test your reflexes and tactics<br>\ud83d\udd39 Full replayability with score attacks, speedruns, and custom challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme speed. Extreme power. Extreme combos.</strong><br>Smash everything in your path and claim your place as the ultimate survivor on Rumble Burst Island!</p>",
